      }
      # elixir: fully-qualified CALLS - each plugin module answers its
      # definition from a zero-arity function, so Config_elixir emits the
      # key with `()` appended and needs no import at all (Elixir resolves
      # modules globally, by their `defmodule`). The `def` path is
